Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good! Yeah! You did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass it over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, yeah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give someone else a shot, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow look unbelievable in the\Nmiddle of the day too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's doing it out here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey chimney girl, we're\Nin the middle of a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your hands if you\Nwant to get spanked. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, chimney girl! Nyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Get the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Ashtray?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You only played for two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it's like when you get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's the nicotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she need an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.78,0:01:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine if I smoke a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:02:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we received an anonymous report\Nof a suspicious person chasing children.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have to try to\Nbe more careful, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, this\Nhappened in Yagami Hara.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,3401.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,3401. 3401.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,3401.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,0101. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that reeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like someone mopped\Nup coffee, cigarette,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and sandal soup with a rag\Nand left it in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or like the concentrated stench\Nof human malice and bitterness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jaku-sa-bu-bura!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The demon Astaroth is\Nupon us, Chainsmoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even understand how bad this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There are over 70 carcinogens\Nin cigarettes. Seventy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that\Nsecondhand smoke is a serious
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,nuisance to non-smoking\Nneighbors like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I getting through to you, Chainsmoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your chance of having\Na stroke has doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cigarette smoke deteriorates\Nyour blood vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There is proof that it\Ncauses heart failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Naggy, naggy, naggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here's my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine is holding a\Nsmoking addiction seminar nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so I brought you this pamphlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, can't see too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd I leave it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this place is gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got a face on\Nthe back of your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're a nicotine\Naddict too, Landlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry hold off on the jokes\Nuntil my face heals a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you put\Non me you fucking cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is this just a sense of guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, she's got shit manners, and\Nthat's her fault a hundred percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but maybe I'm being too harsh towards her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Using a sense of righteousness as\Nan excuse to make myself feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Aniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was too rude just about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chain Smoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-ch-ch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-ch-ch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-ch-ch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, how many fucking\Ncigarettes are you going to smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what a mess you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You said if I gave you an extension,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd do anything to repay me, and\Nthat anything is weeding the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And here you are in a cigarette\Nbreak five minutes into the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and you need a second one already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And can we stop with the yes, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confiscating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will evict you\Nfor failing to pay rent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and littering cigarette\Nbutts all over the lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get it back when you're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I could bring her some iced\Ntea or snacks when she's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you eating something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Horsetail Weeds, I got kinda hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you want some too, Mr. Landlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't eat too many or\Nyou'll get a stomach ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some snacks, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And did she just grow a belly? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to my cabbages?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:09:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.19,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, are those snacks for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm pretty stuffed right now,\Nso I'll just save them for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That goddamn chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always up to no good. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about her\Ngets me all riled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Riled up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Riled... up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage to wallpaper can become a significant\Nfinancial burden when you move out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:10:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Particularly when renting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,one should always be careful about any\Ndiscoloration of the walls from smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The walls were painted this color\Nwhen I moved in. I ventilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the room from time to time So I'm\Nsure it hasn't changed from smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So I should be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn't that poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was already up when I moved in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You think my property is haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seeing stuff to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's talismans hidden on my wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and I heard some loud bangs\Nright after I found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not haunted, then what is landlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to know what happened here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-that's even more suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold me tighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been such a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Yaniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Kansai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you told your baby\Nsister that you were swearing off the baka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mouth disagrees
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll quit for real this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the very last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so I admire the gumption
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Little yon-yon acting the funny\Nman is as scarce as hands tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta follow her up right with a\Ngood punchline Coat your horses, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave to buy milk already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta try and make it to kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.09,0:13:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have a daddy growing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as cool as a jug\Nof branch water, Yan-Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't call myself a cat\Nfrom the West if I give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't get a laugh, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you nasty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this nose hook get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was stuck in this issue of\Nmanga I borrowed from the landlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he put something\Nlike this in a copy of Kirara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you even use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You slip this bit on your\Nnose, and you go, boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You should try it on, then. You're nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck, that nose hook is\Nthe tool of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like we're\Nsecond cousins or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm really curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're curious about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me out of this. Icky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't ask a young debutante like\Nmyself to do such a thing, you chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now, wait a minute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What if this is how I\Ncan get her to crack up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, dang it, just get it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna make this a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just split your sides already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it, you damn chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're meowing up the\Nwrong tree, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna learn today—those\Nare your normal cigarettes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I treated myself and\Nbought some pricey ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't get it. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any besides I was gonna\Nsay about that bird on there Not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,why they call them peace when the bird\Nlooks like one of them migratory ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you know kind of like geese?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One can actually track\Nthe ratio of beast folk to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,humans by how many cigarettes\Nare sold in each region!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can also tell if\Ncitizens had to take out
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,any credit loans on\Ncars they'll never own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda like getting a car on lease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:14:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take a break soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been working all day out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got bills to pay, so I've been\Nbusting my ass working as hard as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting in elbow grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The suspect is currently fleeing\Ntowards Kariba in a chop shop vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mike, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.69,0:15:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A vehicle carrying two greasy\Npigs is coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't call us pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's Beth Palmer's niece!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then will an old face with double-P\Nsigns finally make you laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Humorous time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry with cherries on top, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jane Smoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, you honors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, but do you\Nlike me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't ever complain when I\Nsmoke and you let me drink for free,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so I guess I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cool with whatever, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You cool with making me a drink, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Brought some smoked cheese bites for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't really\Nsay no to smoked cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can dump about half\Na cup of whatever whiskey
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got laying around\Nthe house into a mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow it up with all\Nthe syrup as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:17:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you squirt, squirt, squirt some\Nlemon juice, then add some tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You got high standards, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not gonna waste\Nany, so I'll finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You care about the environment, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's getting a little blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The taste of all this blues is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the cherry on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than the first\Nstep on the path to euphoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I need to lay down for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should probably call it quits too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still wrapped up in the\Nwarm veil of boozy happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aruko, you're down for a nightcap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That drinking party was about\Nas much fun as a root canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was all smiles until I cracked a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,joke and they said I was\Ndesperate for laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for trying to liven\Nup the party a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Smiling like a jackass\Neating wires when they
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,don't got the guts to\Ncrack a joke of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No Sora, that cat won't hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to see St.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Peter myself, I stayed. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to beat\Nme to death's door, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You little class clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,James Boker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,People of Nyagamihara\NCity, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a public service announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to inform you that\Nthe air is very dry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful when\Nyou hit fire outdoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to put out any cigarettes\Nbefore throwing them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wowza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had such\Na beautiful voice, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda sounds like you're\Nfaking it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making y 'all\Nhelp me out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like the person who\Nwas supposed to help out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,heard they're back at work\Nwhile eating a bento box.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bento? Socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're made of cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what an idiot. Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't shoot if we don't\Nhave room to scoot, Yaniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yakuko, open your window. G-got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be funny as all get out\Nif we blasted a toot through the mic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, point it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that tail higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready to blast out another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna let it ring loud\Nenough to wake the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll get him laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but that well's just\Nabout run dry, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you smoke if you pass a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet Jesus, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was a loud one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't they hear us talking too, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those loud ones coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're on your way to free cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I don't think that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have more of my size of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get shot in the van?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck is that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck is that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally wouldn't be mad if\Nyou gave me a push, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the blue blazes\Ndoes this even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My word is that soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get any good grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta flex them glutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like I'm making\Nany progress at all, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, but don't this sort of thing\Nlook like we're batting for the other team?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try and bring me some\Nsix from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you a smack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is flexing your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they scaring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the same hell is wrong with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.28,0:22:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.28,0:23:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we human beings?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what else...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.48,0:23:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.68,0:23:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.68,0:24:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.50,0:24:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
